So it's not like you're just sitting there doing nothing. If you are testing creatives every single week like you're supposed to be doing, then this minimum daily spend is going to be something that is not just, you know

10
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:20,020
You're not just burning money on Facebook. You're actually giving yourself an opportunity to find a winning ad.

11
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:26,880
So, are we at minimum daily spend? That's what minimum daily spend means. It is the amount that you're willing to spend regardless of performance.

12
